# ==============================================================================
# UnfluffRecipes - Environment Configuration Template
# ==============================================================================
# Zero local CLI setup is required for deployment.
# Connect this GitHub repository directly inside the Cloudflare Dashboard.
#
# Optional Bindings & Secrets (configure in Cloudflare Dashboard -> Settings):
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Workers AI Binding:
#    Binding Name: AI
#    Type: Workers AI
#    Purpose: Automatic fallback parser when a recipe page lacks schema.org
#             JSON-LD or has low heuristic confidence.
#
# 2. KV Namespace Binding:
#    Binding Name: RECIPE_KV
#    Type: KV Namespace
#    Purpose: Persistent short-URL storage for 14-day (1,209,600s) shared specs.
#    Note: Even without RECIPE_KV bound, ephemeral 14-day share links still work
#          via HMAC-signed URL tokens.
#
# 3. Optional Secret Environment Variable:
#    SHARE_SIGNING_KEY: Set a custom high-entropy string in Cloudflare Dashboard
#    -> Variables and Secrets to stabilize HMAC signatures across deployments.
# ==============================================================================

SHARE_SIGNING_KEY=
